### Hello Alice
GET http://localhost:8080/hello?name=alice

### Count - Initial (set cookie)
GET http://localhost:8080/count

### Count - Increment (use cookie)
GET http://localhost:8080/count

### Admin Alice - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/admin
Authorization: Basic alice admin

### Admin Bob - 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/admin
Authorization: Basic bob user

### Admin Anonymous - 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/admin
